eam/apps/3981100/extras/0e968915cc8fbdbfc0d6fcf491bad3cd.avif?t=1760090068\" width=1520 height=81 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep track of the progress in your journal, complete objectives, and unlock achievements along the way! Show your friends how it's done, thanks to the in-game <strong>leaderboards</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981100/extras/cd8f6db616c01c18615e563c519db77e.poster.avif?t=1760090068\" width=1170 height=423 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981100/extras/cd8f6db616c01c18615e563c519db77e.webm?t=1760090068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every leaf you move brings the place closer to order. See what you will uncover...</p>","developers":["Eternity"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981100/843d859123e902ca5c15ff53200c4bcb780c3304/header.jpg?t=1760090068","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3981100/72693212/25e21c092b499d54e4c86a1072cc6842e4f6a8f2/1756681499/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757510396","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3981100/72693212/25e21c092b499d54e4c86a1072cc6842e4f6a8f2/1756681499/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757510396","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3981100/72693212/25e21c092b499d54e4c86a1072cc6842e4f6a8f2/1756681499/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757510396","id":257191474,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191474/movie480.mp4?t=1757510396","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/s